        <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:0.9rem;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.5;"><span style="color:#38B2AC;font-weight:bold;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">→</span>Cancel the existing document</div>
